(module aslHarness/cognitionTest :x [testScratchpadConstruction testDyckBalance testTeleologyOntologyFunctor testColimitForcedOntology testManifestSniffing testToolchainResolution testIntentAtomProvenance runTests] :i [(cognition :a cog)])

fn get xs: (List Str) idx: I64 -> Str
  (optionOr (listGet xs idx) "")

fn testScratchpadConstruction -> Bool
  (let [(pad (cog/makeCognitiveScratchpad "intermittent stale search results" (list "cache drop" "replica lag" "lease race") (list "probe redis" "check pg_stat" "reproduce flush") "lease race" (list "atomicLeaseCas" "verifyFuzz") 420 315)) (sud (cog/calculateSud pad.constraintCount pad.tokenCount)) (dir (cog/calculateDir 0.95 1.0))] (do (assert (= pad.perceive "intermittent stale search results")) (assert (= (listLength pad.hypotheses) 3)) (assert (= (listLength pad.falsificationGates) 3)) (assert (= pad.selectedHypothesis "lease race")) (assert (= (listLength pad.actionSteps) 2)) (assert (= pad.tokenCount 420)) (assert (= pad.constraintCount 315)) (assert (= sud 0.75)) (assert (= dir 0.95)) true))

fn testDyckBalance -> Bool
  (let [(validTrace "(:think (:perceive :state 1) (:hypothesize (:h1 :prior 0.5)) (:falsify (:g1 :pass)))") (unbalancedOpen "(:think (:perceive :state 1)") (unbalancedClose "(:think (:perceive :state 1)))") (crossedParens "(:think (:perceive) ) (")] (do (assert (cog/checkDyckBalance validTrace)) (assert (not (cog/checkDyckBalance unbalancedOpen))) (assert (not (cog/checkDyckBalance unbalancedClose))) (assert (not (cog/checkDyckBalance crossedParens))) true))

fn testTeleologyOntologyFunctor -> Bool
  (let [(v0Entities (cog/teleologyToOntology 0)) (v1Entities (cog/teleologyToOntology 1)) (v2Entities (cog/teleologyToOntology 2)) (v3Entities (cog/teleologyToOntology 3)) (v4Entities (cog/teleologyToOntology 4)) (v5Entities (cog/teleologyToOntology 5)) (v6Entities (cog/teleologyToOntology 6))] (do (assert (= (listLength v0Entities) 3)) (assert (= (get v0Entities 0) "humanOverride")) (assert (= (get v0Entities 1) "airgap")) (assert (= (get v0Entities 2) "consentReceipt")) (assert (= (listLength v1Entities) 4)) (assert (= (get v1Entities 0) "owns")) (assert (= (get v1Entities 1) "vfsBuffer")) (assert (= (get v1Entities 2) "delimiterState")) (assert (= (get v1Entities 3) "invariantGuard")) (assert (= (listLength v2Entities) 3)) (assert (= (get v2Entities 0) "intentAtom")) (assert (= (get v2Entities 1) "sMap")) (assert (= (get v2Entities 2) "acceptanceCriteria")) (assert (= (listLength v3Entities) 5)) (assert (= (get v3Entities 0) "claim")) (assert (= (get v3Entities 1) "falsificationGate")) (assert (= (get v3Entities 2) "mutant")) (assert (= (get v3Entities 3) "fMap")) (assert (= (get v3Entities 4) "witness")) (assert (= (listLength v4Entities) 4)) (assert (= (get v4Entities 0) "diffHunk")) (assert (= (get v4Entities 1) "entropyBudget")) (assert (= (get v4Entities 2) "bMap")) (assert (= (get v4Entities 3) "causalCone")) (assert (= (listLength v5Entities) 3)) (assert (= (get v5Entities 0) "asnSexpr")) (assert (= (get v5Entities 1) "bareSymbol")) (assert (= (get v5Entities 2) "tokenCompressor")) (assert (= (listLength v6Entities) 3)) (assert (= (get v6Entities 0) "memoCache")) (assert (= (get v6Entities 1) "pipelineScheduler")) (assert (= (get v6Entities 2) "batchAction")) true))

fn testColimitForcedOntology -> Bool
  (let [(fullOntology (cog/getForcedOntologyEntities 6))] (do (assert (= (listLength fullOntology) 25)) true))

fn testManifestSniffing -> Bool
  (do (assert (= (cog/detectEcosystemFromManifest "crates/server/Cargo.toml") "rust")) (assert (= (cog/detectEcosystemFromManifest "backend/pyproject.toml") "python")) (assert (= (cog/detectEcosystemFromManifest "legacy/setup.py") "python")) (assert (= (cog/detectEcosystemFromManifest "frontend/package.json") "nodeTypescript")) (assert (= (cog/detectEcosystemFromManifest "services/auth/go.mod") "go")) (assert (= (cog/detectEcosystemFromManifest "native/CMakeLists.txt") "cpp")) (assert (= (cog/detectEcosystemFromManifest "core/Makefile") "cSystem")) (assert (= (cog/detectEcosystemFromManifest "asl.json") "asl")) (assert (= (cog/detectEcosystemFromManifest "unknown.txt") "unknown")) true)

fn testToolchainResolution -> Bool
  (let [(rustManifest (cog/resolveToolchainCommands "rust")) (pyManifest (cog/resolveToolchainCommands "python")) (tsManifest (cog/resolveToolchainCommands "nodeTypescript")) (goManifest (cog/resolveToolchainCommands "go")) (aslManifest (cog/resolveToolchainCommands "asl"))] (do (assert (= rustManifest.ecosystem "rust")) (assert (= rustManifest.buildCmd "cargo check")) (assert (= rustManifest.testCmd "cargo test")) (assert (= rustManifest.lintCmd "cargo clippy")) (assert (= pyManifest.ecosystem "python")) (assert (= pyManifest.testCmd "pytest")) (assert (= pyManifest.lintCmd "ruff check")) (assert (= tsManifest.ecosystem "nodeTypescript")) (assert (= tsManifest.buildCmd "npm run build")) (assert (= tsManifest.testCmd "npm test")) (assert (= goManifest.ecosystem "go")) (assert (= goManifest.buildCmd "go build ./...")) (assert (= goManifest.testCmd "go test ./...")) (assert (= aslManifest.ecosystem "asl")) (assert (= aslManifest.buildCmd "./bin/asl check")) (assert (= aslManifest.testCmd "./bin/asl test")) (assert (= aslManifest.lintCmd "./bin/asl audit")) true))

fn testIntentAtomProvenance -> Bool
  (let [(prompt "Please implement atomic lease CAS flush to prevent dirty buffer lost updates.") (groundedAtom (cog/makeIntentAtom "a1" "implement" "atomicLeaseCas" "no lost update" "atomic lease CAS flush" 0.95 true)) (hallucinatedAtom (cog/makeIntentAtom "a2" "refactor" "quantumCrypto" "quantum proof" "quantum encryption" 0.90 false)) (unboundAtom (cog/makeIntentAtom "a3" "optimize" "cache" "latency < 1ms" "" 0.40 true))] (do (assert (cog/validateAtomProvenance groundedAtom prompt)) (assert (not (cog/validateAtomProvenance hallucinatedAtom prompt))) (assert (not (cog/validateAtomProvenance unboundAtom prompt))) (assert (cog/isAtomGrounded groundedAtom)) (assert (not (cog/isAtomGrounded hallucinatedAtom))) (assert (not (cog/isAtomGrounded unboundAtom))) true))

fn runTests -> Bool
  (do (assert (testScratchpadConstruction)) (assert (testDyckBalance)) (assert (testTeleologyOntologyFunctor)) (assert (testColimitForcedOntology)) (assert (testManifestSniffing)) (assert (testToolchainResolution)) (assert (testIntentAtomProvenance)) true)
